      "data": {
        "text": "**Defining the Framework**\n\nOkay, I've decided to build this around Google Cloud's Vertex AI. This focus will make the code concrete and allow for real-world testing. Now, I need to figure out the essential interactions with the Vertex AI client to establish the foundation.\n\n\n**Constructing the Invocation**\n\nI'm now zeroing in on the Python file structure. The goal is a `invoke_platform_model.py ` that leverages Vertex AI. The code will center on invoking a text model, using  `google.cloud.aiplatform` to handle the client interaction. My next step will be to flesh out the function to streamline the Vertex AI client and perform a model prediction. The focus is to make things concrete, and clearly show Vertex AI as the provider.\n\n\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789862043576,
          "start": 1789862041240
        },
        "type": "reasoning"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bc1756980014Du7cHJoH5dJmQ",
